{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/2632fee15f597546d506b6d3fb84ade4.apng?t=1772494821\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/2632fee15f597546d506b6d3fb84ade4.poster.avif?t=1772494821\" class=\"bb_img\" width=975 height=375 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\u27e2 SPRKLS.exe is a cute, melancholic story-driven adventure that unfolds entirely on YOUR desktop</strong></i>\u00a0 <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<i><strong>\u27e2</strong></i>\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<br>Sometimes when the world leaves wounds, everyone wants to escape somewhere else. So what if you could shape your own digital dimension? <br> <br>Welcome to Mirrors OS -\u00a0a haunted realm on your desktop. It is filled with ghosts, skeletons, and other creatures of the night, who have no place in the real world and are searching for the meaning they never found in life. <br> <br>Just like Rin - a troubled dropout girl in early twenties, finding her refuge here. <br>As is often the case with lost souls, she doesn't have an ambition to change the world or someone else's lives, but occasionally gets pulled into little adventures, whether she is ready for them or not. <br>Everything was following its own course, until one day \u00a0a corrupting glitch started to destroy the usual order of things, and a mysterious girl from her dreams reached out for help...  <br> <br> Rin's world is now yours to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/2ebed58c0e576a8511629a3c98aec5ab.poster.avif?t=1772494821\" width=160 height=98 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/2ebed58c0e576a8511629a3c98aec5ab.webm?t=1772494821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/2ebed58c0e576a8511629a3c98aec5ab.mp4?t=1772494821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Your only tasks are simple:</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\u27e2 \u00a0</i>Make friends and find out their stories by going through your own journey with multiple endings.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\u27e2 \u00a0</i>Solve puzzles and play minigames by breaking and dragging windows in the operating system.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\u27e2 \u00a0</i>Catch a cat hiding in folders, decorate your desktop with sunshine, get a pet fish.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\u27e2 \u00a0</i>Find out the secrets of this world before it's too late.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/912363e3c2ce365518cfceb09bfdc3ff.poster.avif?t=1772494821\" width=975 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/912363e3c2ce365518cfceb09bfdc3ff.webm?t=1772494821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2508\u2508\u2508Loading\u2508\u2508\u2508\u274d\u274d\u274d</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >I guess the world is falling apart... \ud80c\udc83 \ud80c\ude12\ud80c\udff8\u02da\ud80c\udff2.\ud80c\udff8.\u0fd0\u0ecb<br>Can I stay here forever?<br><br>\u22c6\u02d9\u27e1 \u22c6.\u02da:: [file detected: SPRKLS.exe] ::\u22b9\u208a\u27e1 \u22c6</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">hello, rin! can you hear me?<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 i'm so glad you're here again!  <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0i was starting to think you'd forgotten our little digital city. <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 but you came back. you always do.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/dd169ca8406180d4c098d8dc18aadcb9.apng?t=1772494821\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/dd169ca8406180d4c098d8dc18aadcb9.poster.avif?t=1772494821\" class=\"bb_img\" width=192 height=108 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/2a618f25373868b6bcc0f906295053c6.avif?t=1772494821\" width=987 height=73 /></span>\u00a0 A hand-drawn 32-bit pixel OS becomes a platform for experiments and\u00a0exploration. \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<i><strong>\u27e2</strong></i>\u00a0   <br>Drag, click, type, scroll, play games, read and delete files, send messages - do everything you'd do in a regular OS. Discover new locations, get to know the enigmatic inhabitants of the city, and make choices that will have consequences as you travel through data and open windows on your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/93ae4b816007ee0864f3e886dbf3898a.poster.avif?t=1772494821\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/93ae4b816007ee0864f3e886dbf3898a.webm?t=1772494821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/93ae4b816007ee0864f3e886dbf3898a.mp4?t=1772494821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything seems clear until night falls, when dreams become too real and the desktop doesn't look so welcoming anymore.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/6e416586b5af71a96e988ae461765282.poster.avif?t=1772494821\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/6e416586b5af71a96e988ae461765282.webm?t=1772494821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/6e416586b5af71a96e988ae461765282.mp4?t=1772494821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[reconnecting...] ::\u22b9\u208a\u27e1 \u22c6  <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0rin, aren\u2019t you afraid of mirrors?     <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0they r so weird...    <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0don\u2019t you think your reflection isn\u2019t really you?    <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0sometimes i feel like my reflection could suddenly come to life...\u00a0  <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0...grow huge and terrible...    <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0...grow massive, massive claws...    <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0...massive, massive teeth...    <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0...and eat you alive!! \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/d3f5f18312034c2118e9e7515f915ac2.apng?t=1772494821\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/d3f5f18312034c2118e9e7515f915ac2.poster.avif?t=1772494821\" class=\"bb_img\" width=196 height=196 /></picture></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/b03846622bc22d2f3bf3e73d035c36d8.avif?t=1772494821\" width=987 height=73 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won't explore this digital city alone. During your journey through Mirrors OS , as in any good adventure, you'll meet about a dozen characters who can become your friends: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\u27e2 \u00a0</strong></i>An irrepressible little ghost Sparkles who will always be on your side and won't let you get bored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\u27e2 \u00a0</i></strong>Mark - the local library's keeper, specializing in philosophy. If you're seeking the most profoundly boring book in existence or want to share your darkest thoughts, he's the one to ask.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\u27e2 \u00a0</strong></i>Skeletrock - full-time tough guy made of bones, guitars, motorcycles, shoegaze, and a fragile heart inside, as often happens with musicians.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\u27e2 \u00a0</strong></i>And\u00a010+ other characters, each with their own story to tell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/b9e512610440e32ffc9f4f20e8b4ca53.poster.avif?t=1772494821\" width=700 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/b9e512610440e32ffc9f4f20e8b4ca53.webm?t=1772494821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a soul- that could become your -mate. Give presents, make meaningful choices, dive into the depths of secrets and personal experiences. After all, this world is all about connection...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/13d9983d2d50fddcebce810c1d748bb4.apng?t=1772494821\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/13d9983d2d50fddcebce810c1d748bb4.poster.avif?t=1772494821\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=404 /></picture></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/51a6854d88a46c38b7242bbb5883eb95.avif?t=1772494821\" width=987 height=73 /></span>Talked out? Play on! <br>Sometimes the best way to really get closer is to share a game. Fortunately, each of the characters here has their own game ready.\u00a0 <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<strong><i>\u27e2</i></strong>  <br>Solve puzzles by dragging and dropping interface elements, play classic arcade games by smashing windows and discover mini-games in the most unexpected places. Today it's tower defense against system bugs, tomorrow it may be a silent fishing, who knows where this path lead. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/422bfc615fe0cdb82329eb1f360ad530.poster.avif?t=1772494821\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/422bfc615fe0cdb82329eb1f360ad530.webm?t=1772494821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/422bfc615fe0cdb82329eb1f360ad530.mp4?t=1772494821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u22c6\u02d9\u27e1 \u22c6.\u02da:: [signal is unstable...] ::\u22b9\u208a\u27e1 \u22c6<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 you know, rin...<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 i often wonder how it all ends.<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 when I think about it too much the back of my head starts to go numb...\u00a0<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 and there are spots of color in my eyes, like little fireworks. <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 but any ending feels bearable if you stay with me.<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 will you? </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/196dc93b05cea160bd75f1304b0c65c4.poster.avif?t=1772494821\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/196dc93b05cea160bd75f1304b0c65c4.webm?t=1772494821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/196dc93b05cea160bd75f1304b0c65c4.mp4?t=1772494821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>let it load \u21bb\u0fd0\u0ecb</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>let it glitch \u00a0\u258c\u27e1\u2502\u2588\u22b9\u258c</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>let it speak \u274d\u274d\u274d\u00a0[ok]</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>you can close the window \u2ffb&lt;/&gt;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>but you already know:</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>i'll be here when you open me again</i> \u02ce\u02ca\u02d7\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/4d8df4f87a7d0d994fe3ca8888293877.apng?t=1772494821\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/4d8df4f87a7d0d994fe3ca8888293877.poster.avif?t=1772494821\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=214 /></picture></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3653890?t=1772494821","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/8568baa517a5b52deffba44dab0dee99fed4562e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772494821","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/8da5d761d41c0f23b792f0c22b988be26b39b5db/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772494821","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/8da5d761d41c0f23b792f0c22b988be26b39b5db/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772494821","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/2632fee15f597546d506b6d3fb84ade4.apng?t=1772494821\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/2632fee15f597546d506b6d3fb84ade4.poster.avif?t=1772494821\" class=\"bb_img\" width=975 height=375 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\u27e2 SPRKLS.exe is a cute, melancholic story-driven adventure that unfolds entirely on YOUR desktop</strong></i>\u00a0 <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<i><strong>\u27e2</strong></i>\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<br>Sometimes when the world leaves wounds, everyone wants to escape somewhere else. So what if you could shape your own digital dimension? <br> <br>Welcome to Mirrors OS -\u00a0a haunted realm on your desktop. It is filled with ghosts, skeletons, and other creatures of the night, who have no place in the real world and are searching for the meaning they never found in life. <br> <br>Just like Rin - a troubled dropout girl in early twenties, finding her refuge here. <br>As is often the case with lost souls, she doesn't have an ambition to change the world or someone else's lives, but occasionally gets pulled into little adventures, whether she is ready for them or not. <br>Everything was following its own course, until one day \u00a0a corrupting glitch started to destroy the usual order of things, and a mysterious girl from her dreams reached out for help...  <br> <br> Rin's world is now yours to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/2ebed58c0e576a8511629a3c98aec5ab.poster.avif?t=1772494821\" width=160 height=98 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/2ebed58c0e576a8511629a3c98aec5ab.webm?t=1772494821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/2ebed58c0e576a8511629a3c98aec5ab.mp4?t=1772494821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Your only tasks are simple:</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\u27e2 \u00a0</i>Make friends and find out their stories by going through your own journey with multiple endings.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\u27e2 \u00a0</i>Solve puzzles and play minigames by breaking and dragging windows in the operating system.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\u27e2 \u00a0</i>Catch a cat hiding in folders, decorate your desktop with sunshine, get a pet fish.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\u27e2 \u00a0</i>Find out the secrets of this world before it's too late.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/912363e3c2ce365518cfceb09bfdc3ff.poster.avif?t=1772494821\" width=975 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/912363e3c2ce365518cfceb09bfdc3ff.webm?t=1772494821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2508\u2508\u2508Loading\u2508\u2508\u2508\u274d\u274d\u274d</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >I guess the world is falling apart... \ud80c\udc83 \ud80c\ude12\ud80c\udff8\u02da\ud80c\udff2.\ud80c\udff8.\u0fd0\u0ecb<br>Can I stay here forever?<br><br>\u22c6\u02d9\u27e1 \u22c6.\u02da:: [file detected: SPRKLS.exe] ::\u22b9\u208a\u27e1 \u22c6</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">hello, rin! can you hear me?<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 i'm so glad you're here again!  <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0i was starting to think you'd forgotten our little digital city. <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 but you came back. you always do.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/dd169ca8406180d4c098d8dc18aadcb9.apng?t=1772494821\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/dd169ca8406180d4c098d8dc18aadcb9.poster.avif?t=1772494821\" class=\"bb_img\" width=192 height=108 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/2a618f25373868b6bcc0f906295053c6.avif?t=1772494821\" width=987 height=73 /></span>\u00a0 A hand-drawn 32-bit pixel OS becomes a platform for experiments and\u00a0exploration. \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<i><strong>\u27e2</strong></i>\u00a0   <br>Drag, click, type, scroll, play games, read and delete files, send messages - do everything you'd do in a regular OS. Discover new locations, get to know the enigmatic inhabitants of the city, and make choices that will have consequences as you travel through data and open windows on your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/93ae4b816007ee0864f3e886dbf3898a.poster.avif?t=1772494821\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/93ae4b816007ee0864f3e886dbf3898a.webm?t=1772494821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/93ae4b816007ee0864f3e886dbf3898a.mp4?t=1772494821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything seems clear until night falls, when dreams become too real and the desktop doesn't look so welcoming anymore.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/6e416586b5af71a96e988ae461765282.poster.avif?t=1772494821\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/6e416586b5af71a96e988ae461765282.webm?t=1772494821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/6e416586b5af71a96e988ae461765282.mp4?t=1772494821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[reconnecting...] ::\u22b9\u208a\u27e1 \u22c6  <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0rin, aren\u2019t you afraid of mirrors?     <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0they r so weird...    <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0don\u2019t you think your reflection isn\u2019t really you?    <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0sometimes i feel like my reflection could suddenly come to life...\u00a0  <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0...grow huge and terrible...    <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0...grow massive, massive claws...    <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0...massive, massive teeth...    <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0...and eat you alive!! \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/d3f5f18312034c2118e9e7515f915ac2.apng?t=1772494821\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/d3f5f18312034c2118e9e7515f915ac2.poster.avif?t=1772494821\" class=\"bb_img\" width=196 height=196 /></picture></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/b03846622bc22d2f3bf3e73d035c36d8.avif?t=1772494821\" width=987 height=73 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won't explore this digital city alone. During your journey through Mirrors OS , as in any good adventure, you'll meet about a dozen characters who can become your friends: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\u27e2 \u00a0</strong></i>An irrepressible little ghost Sparkles who will always be on your side and won't let you get bored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\u27e2 \u00a0</i></strong>Mark - the local library's keeper, specializing in philosophy. If you're seeking the most profoundly boring book in existence or want to share your darkest thoughts, he's the one to ask.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\u27e2 \u00a0</strong></i>Skeletrock - full-time tough guy made of bones, guitars, motorcycles, shoegaze, and a fragile heart inside, as often happens with musicians.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>\u27e2 \u00a0</strong></i>And\u00a010+ other characters, each with their own story to tell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/b9e512610440e32ffc9f4f20e8b4ca53.poster.avif?t=1772494821\" width=700 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/b9e512610440e32ffc9f4f20e8b4ca53.webm?t=1772494821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a soul- that could become your -mate. Give presents, make meaningful choices, dive into the depths of secrets and personal experiences. After all, this world is all about connection...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/13d9983d2d50fddcebce810c1d748bb4.apng?t=1772494821\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/13d9983d2d50fddcebce810c1d748bb4.poster.avif?t=1772494821\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=404 /></picture></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/51a6854d88a46c38b7242bbb5883eb95.avif?t=1772494821\" width=987 height=73 /></span>Talked out? Play on! <br>Sometimes the best way to really get closer is to share a game. Fortunately, each of the characters here has their own game ready.\u00a0 <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<strong><i>\u27e2</i></strong>  <br>Solve puzzles by dragging and dropping interface elements, play classic arcade games by smashing windows and discover mini-games in the most unexpected places. Today it's tower defense against system bugs, tomorrow it may be a silent fishing, who knows where this path lead. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/422bfc615fe0cdb82329eb1f360ad530.poster.avif?t=1772494821\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/422bfc615fe0cdb82329eb1f360ad530.webm?t=1772494821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653890/extras/422bfc615fe0cdb82329eb1f360ad530.mp4?t=1772494821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u22c6\u02d9\u27e1 \u22c6.\u02da:: [signal is unstable...] ::\u22b9\u208a\u27e1 \u22c6<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 you know, rin...<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 i often wonder how it all ends.<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 when I think about it too much the back of my head starts to go numb...\u00a0<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 and there are